FlashInfer PrimTS validation suite

This product includes benchmark code derived from FlashInfer.

The native sparse MLA benchmark and cold-L2 CUDA Graph timer are adapted from
the validation campaign for FlashInfer PR #5434 (implementation 8ac751ee).
Preparation and FP64 reference helpers are loaded from the selected FlashInfer
checkout. The preparation helper credits the vLLM project under Apache-2.0.

The sparse-attention benchmark driver and manifest helpers are derived from
PerkzZheng/vllm at b10972e13c51d0ba61906e64e9b01b87bd6a0549:
benchmarks/kernels/benchmark_q_token_kv_block_sparse_ts_suites.py.
